                  "width": 760,
                  "content": "The foundations: color, typography, spacing, and radius. Components and composites live in the frames to the right. A flat, shadowless, theme-aware system set in Onest, Inter, and Playfair Display. Every value mirrors packages/ui/src/theme.",
