                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1240,
                  "content": "The palette invents nothing. Every group in it is one level of the hierarchy asking the same question the chrome already asks — the project scopes the candidates, the mode says which commands exist, the selected resource says which panels fit, and the focused panel offers its own. If a thing is reachable by clicking, it is reachable by typing, and for the same reason.",
