              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1180,
              "content": "The renderer draws one set of resources. A single header names the saved views and holds Search and the Filter, Sort, and Display menus; the body swaps between a detailed list and a kanban board. Display is a setting on the renderer, not a mode of the workbench — which is why a saved view can pin both at once: the filter that narrows the set, and the display that draws it.",
