                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The column plus opens a form the host renders from declarations. Properties derive from the resource's editable attributes and are seeded from the selected column; content fields are declared by the create contribution as typed params, each mapping to one @pstdio/ui control. A control the vocabulary lacks gets added to the vocabulary — not worked around with a custom renderer or a webview. Primary click on a card opens its resource. Secondary click opens actions. Kanban cards have no chevron.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
