                  "name": "D",
                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A view names what narrows the set, the order inside it, and the display that draws it: its filter, its sorts, and its display settings. Switching to a saved view can change which rows are present, how they are ordered, and whether they are rows at all. The criteria row under the names shows the active sort and every filter rule. Open Filter, Sort, or Display to change them. Editing any of them marks the view and raises Reset / Save. Search never does.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
