            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gosfZ",
              "name": "Summary",
              "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1550,
              "content": "The global header owns the project selector alongside history and breadcrumbs, matching the Nav Chrome component. The Sidenav starts with Search, Notifications, Sessions, Workspaces, and Tickets. Its resource region appears only for the selected resource and contains that resource's children. Aggregate pages live in Main Panel and never duplicate their collection inside Side Panel.",
