    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "B5M3w",
      "x": 12880,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Tree Navigation · Component",
      "context": "TreeList (packages/ui/src/components/tree-list) — sectioned, keyboard-navigable tree used for sidenavs, file trees and changed-file lists. Data: sections[{id,label?,collapsible?,actions?,emptyState?,nodes}] with nodes = ListRowItem + children. The composite has 8px padding on both axes. Rows render through cmp/TreeListRow (ListRow variant tree|compact): h 30, radius 4, px 8, gap 7, indent $tree-pl (8/26/44) per depth. Row states use the tree theme axis default|active|hover; depth uses 0|1|2. Controlled props: expandedSectionIds / expandedNodeIds / activeNodeId + onToggleSection / onToggleNode / onNavigate. Virtualizes long trees (32px row estimate). In the Sidenav, right-clicking anywhere opens one customize menu for hideable header, main, and footer items. Drag ordering persists per tree id and stays inside the item's region and group; canReorder=false locks exceptions. Visibility and order reset independently.",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "dark"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1960,
      "fill": "$ds-bg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 30,
