              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1180,
              "content": "The sidenav's spine: a sectioned, keyboard-navigable tree that renders workspaces, file trees, saved views and changed-file lists from one row primitive. Groups collapse, rows nest on a fixed indent scale, file icons resolve per type, actions stay hidden until a row is hovered or focused, and every move the pointer can make has a key. This frame is the visual contract for cmp/TreeListRow and the TreeList composite.",
