              "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "One editor per tag definition. The header renames the tag inline and switches between single and multiple selection. Options are flat 40px rows — drag the grip to reorder, click the name to rename, and a single leading swatch opens the appearance popover where color and an optional icon live together. No table chrome, no card per option: hairline dividers carry the list. Destructive actions stay quiet until hover, and the footer is the only commit point.",
