                  "name": "Section Caption",
                  "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A state carries where it can go next, and nothing about what it means. Creating an item is a command on a state, not a separate field, so the states you can create into are the ones whose commands include Create. Two booleans could only say a state accepts anything or nothing; a successor list says In Review can reach Done but not Backlog, which is what a state machine is for. Reachable and terminal stop being stored at all.",
