              "type": "text",
              "id": "bwHzd",
              "name": "Sub",
              "fill": "$ds-fg-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1180,
              "content": "The data table and the kanban renderer share one view bar and one view model. Search narrows what is on screen right now. Filter and Sort describe the view and are saved with it. Every control reads as a sentence, so a person and an agent describe the same view the same way: \"Status is not Done, and Priority is any of High, Urgent, sorted by Priority, then Updated.\"",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
