                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "New building blocks, now masters in Components › Collections & views. Each one reuses existing tokens: rule rows and pills share the FilterPill shape (h 24, radius 4, surface on a border hairline), popovers share the menu shell. cmp/CollectionViewBar replaces cmp/KanbanRendererViewBar, and the Display menus no longer have Ordering or Sorting rows.",
