                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Search narrows the cards inside the saved view's filter, as you type. It matches the text a card shows: title, id, and the visible properties. Matches are marked, and each column counts matching cards against its total, so an empty column reads as 'nothing matched here', not 'nothing exists'. Search does not mark the view as changed, and Save stays hidden: the criteria row still lists only what the view stores.",
