                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The data table uses the same view bar as the board. A sorted column shows its direction and, when there is more than one sort, its level. The field menu on a header is a shortcut: Sort descending on Score replaces both sorts with Score, and the Sort pill, the header marks, and the Sort menu all change together because they read one list. The tab dot and Reset / Save appear because the sort is not saved yet.",
